{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1453144-styx-and-bones","id":1453144,"title":"Styx and Bones","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-06-22T05:59:45-07:00","id":1453144,"title":"Styx and Bones","content":"I have been asked to run Styx and Bones. I want to stick close to the original material in this case and end it after 3-4 sessions.<br /> <br /> <b>Have you tried it? What would you change?</b><br /> <br /> It seems like a nice short module that is fairly logical to me. Only minor inconsistencies.<br /> <br /> <br /> - The auction seems odd. Why send a coterie of semi outsiders? Without nearly enough payment? Without sufficient motivation? To acquire the most important relic this side of the alps.<br /> <br /> - The coterie will have several murder scenes and will probably investigate, but there is nothing to find. That could be time intensive and frustrating.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Overall the story seems quite passive.</b>There is no decision to make that will change the outcome. There is no moral quandary. It does not involve cults? I mean you have cults, but for this story they might just be any other type of group.<br /> <br /> I want the coterie to <i>chose </i>the sacrifices (wake up snack) for the ritual and lean into the questions: Why are you ok with this person dying? Why is this a worthy sacrifice to you and/or your cult?<br /> <br /> I want the prince in the end not to go &quot;ok thanks&quot;, but &quot;I want a head on a stake. Someone has to publicly pay for this. Bring me Mother Anjas head.&quot; I would not even play this out. I want to keep the story short, but I would like to know what they intend to <i>do</i>. Fulfill the order? Side with family over the prince? Offer something else?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26030,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26030-mfalkenb","user":"mfalkenb","date":". 06-22-2021, 09:26 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26030-mfalkenb","name":"mfalkenb","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"49"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}